OL,3,AMandelson kept lobby firm shares for
OL,4,Amonths as ambassador, despite conflict
OL,5,Aof interest fears
OL,6,
OL,7,FLord Mandelson kept shares in a lobby
OL,8,Ffirm for months while US ambassador as
OL,9,Fhe felt he had not been made a fair
OL,10,Foffer, newly released documents show
OL,12,FMandelson became the UK ambassador to
OL,13,Fthe US in February 2025 - a letter in
OL,14,FMarch that year, from the head of the
OL,15,FForeign Office, said "the ideal" would
OL,16,Fhave been for Mandelson to sell his
OL,17,Fshares
OL,19,FThe documents show senior officials
OL,20,Fwere concerned about potential
OL,21,Fconflicts of interest from his
OL,22,Fshareholding
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
