OL,3,AMandelson kept lobby firm shares for
OL,4,Amonths as ambassador, despite conflict
OL,5,Aof interest fears
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the UK, police are investigating
OL,8,Fallegations that Mandelson, while
OL,9,Fserving as a minister, passed on
OL,10,Fmarket-sensitive information to the
OL,11,Flate convicted sex offender Jeffrey
OL,12,FEpstein
OL,14,FMandelson - who was sacked as US
OL,15,Fambassador in September 2025 - has
OL,16,Frepeatedly let it be known he believes
OL,17,Fhe has not acted criminally, did not
OL,18,Fact for personal gain, and is
OL,19,Fco-operating with the police
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
